<% if @company %>
Welcome to <%= @company.name %>!
<% elsif @user.delegated_admin? %>
Welcome as a Delegated Admin!
<% else %>
Welcome to Way To Excellence!
<% end %>

Hello <%= @user.name %>,

<% if @company %>
You've been invited to join <%= @company.name %> on our platform.

Your role: <%= @user.company_user&.role&.humanize || 'User' %>
<% elsif @user.delegated_admin? %>
You've been invited as a Delegated Admin on our platform.
<% if @user.permissions_array.any? %>
Your permissions:
<% @user.permissions_array.each do |permission| %>
<% permission_key = User::PERMISSIONS.key(permission) %>
- <%= permission_key ? t("permissions.#{permission_key}") : permission.humanize %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% else %>
You've been invited to join our platform.
<% end %>

To get started, please set up your password by visiting the link below:

<%= @invitation_url %>

This invitation link will expire in 7 days. If you didn't expect this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.

